{"case_id": "pandas-cpp-xsimd-neon64-v2-001", "context_method": "raw", "diagnoser": "copilot-sol-compat", "mode": "root_cause_diagnosis", "summary": "The editable pandas build failed while compiling the ARM64 NEON SIMD moments sources. Explicit template instantiations using xsimd::neon64 did not match a candidate whose corresponding signature used xsimd::neon.", "root_cause_category": "compile_error", "root_cause": "The NEON moments code explicitly instantiates accumulate_moments_simd::operator() with xsimd::neon64, but the compiler reports that the candidate template signature does not match because the compared signature uses xsimd::neon.", "confidence": 0.99, "relevant_files": ["pandas/_libs/simd/moments_inst_neon.cpp", "pandas/_libs/include/pandas/simd/moments_simd.hpp", "pandas/_libs/simd/moments.cpp"], "relevant_tests": [], "evidence": [{"quote": "FAILED: [code=1] pandas/_libs/simd/libmoments_simd_neon.a.p/moments_inst_neon.cpp.o", "reason": "Identifies the failed C++ compilation target for the NEON implementation."}, {"quote": "../../pandas/_libs/include/pandas/simd/moments_simd.hpp:255:50: error: explicit instantiation of 'operator()' does not refer to a function template, variable template, member function, member class, or static data member", "reason": "Shows the direct compiler error at the extern template instantiation."}, {"quote": "candidate template ignored: could not match 'Moments (xsimd::neon64, std::span<const double>, int, std::optional<std::span<const uint8_t>>, int) noexcept' (aka 'Moments (xsimd::neon64, span<const double>, int, optional<span<const unsigned char>>, int) noexcept') against 'Moments (xsimd::neon, std::span<const double>, int, std::optional<std::span<const uint8_t>>, int)' (aka 'Moments (xsimd::neon, span<const double>, int, optional<span<const unsigned char>>, int)')", "reason": "Explicitly states the signature mismatch between xsimd::neon64 and xsimd::neon."}, {"quote": "../../pandas/_libs/simd/moments_inst_neon.cpp:14:43: error: explicit instantiation of 'operator()' does not refer to a function template, variable template, member function, member class, or static data member", "reason": "Confirms the same invalid explicit instantiation in the NEON implementation source."}, {"quote": "ninja: build stopped: subcommand failed.", "reason": "Confirms that the compilation errors stopped the build."}], "suggested_fix": "Make the NEON explicit instantiations in pandas/_libs/include/pandas/simd/moments_simd.hpp and pandas/_libs/simd/moments_inst_neon.cpp use the same xsimd architecture type as the accumulate_moments_simd::operator() signature, eliminating the xsimd::neon64 versus xsimd::neon mismatch.", "input": {"context_path": "results/v2/holdout/raw/pandas-cpp-xsimd-neon64-v2-001.txt", "context_tokens_estimate": 35666}, "usage": {"processing_tokens_estimate": 0, "output_tokens_estimate": 1032}, "metadata": {"provider": "command", "prompt_sha256": "ecffdf03c99a91b0f8f75e086720d9fb8db96af0d9dae5285baf679c9c9d28de", "runtime_ms": 10700.672, "cache_key": "4b9ad5bba562fa8809a4fd12d83941ab7d7703663615654d381b0d2d154e8a84", "provider_error": null, "provider_error_detail": null, "command": "python3 examples/diagnosis_shim_copilot_cli.py", "model_info": {"provider_name": "github-copilot", "requested_model": "gpt-5.6-sol", "resolved_model": "gpt-5.6-sol", "cli_version": "GitHub Copilot CLI 1.0.82.", "reasoning_effort_requested": "low", "context_mode": "default", "max_context_chars": 480000, "tools_available": 0, "custom_instructions": false, "isolated_copilot_home": true, "model_version": "gpt-5.6-sol", "max_context_window_tokens": 400000, "max_prompt_tokens_capability": 272000, "tokenizer": "o200k_base", "reasoning_effort_resolved": "low", "max_prompt_tokens": 272000, "tool_count": 0, "usage": {"completion_tokens": 705, "prompt_tokens": 64522, "total_tokens": 65227, "prompt_tokens_details": {"cached_tokens": 0, "cache_creation_tokens": 64519, "cache_ttl_seconds": 1800}, "completion_tokens_details": {